OL,3,GNEWSAAward for passers-by who saved
OL,4,Awoman on bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree passers-by who "clung to" a woman
OL,7,Fto prevent her from falling off a
OL,8,Fbridge have been given a police award.
OL,10,FNicole Presland and brothers Dan and
OL,11,FBen Thompson got out of their cars to
OL,12,Fhelp a vulnerable woman on a bridge
OL,13,Fthat crosses the A12, Essex Police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FNicole was driving through Braiswick
OL,17,Fnear Colchester on a night in January
OL,18,Fwhen she saw a woman standing in the
OL,19,Froad who didn't react when she swerved
OL,20,Faround her.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
