OL,3,GNEWSAAward for passers-by who saved
OL,4,Awoman on bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Constable Rachel Nolan said:
OL,7,F"Many other people drove past the woman
OL,8,Fthat night. It was late, it was dark,
OL,9,Fand it would have been easy for them to
OL,10,Fdo the same, but they stopped and
OL,11,Fhelped."
